2>《池上》</h2>\n        <div class=\"author\">【唐】白居易</div>\n        <p class=\"verse\">\n          小娃撑小艇，<br>\n          偷采白莲回。<br>\n          不解藏踪迹，<br>\n          浮萍一道开。\n        </p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"poem pool\">\n        <h2>《小池》</h2>\n        <div class=\"author\">【宋】杨万里</div>\n        <p class=\"verse\">\n          泉眼无声惜细流，<br>\n          树阴照水爱晴柔。<br>\n          小荷才露尖尖角，<br>\n          早有蜻蜓立上头。\n        </p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"poem chicken\">\n        <h2>《画鸡》</h2>\n        <div class=\"author\">【明】唐寅</div>\n        <p class=\"verse\">\n          头上红冠不用裁，<br>\n          满身雪白走将来。<br>\n          平生不敢轻言语，<br>\n          一叫千门万户开。\n        </p>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
